`verilator_config
// SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Alexei Zverovitch
// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
//
// For SIM=verilator (see Makefile): cocotb reaches only the testbench's own signals, the
// chip's pins, so only those are made visible to it. Making every net visible (Verilator's
// default under cocotb) slowed the gate-level build from under a minute to about 16.
public_flat_rw -module "tb" -var "*"
